### PackPilot - packing-generator-service
### IntelliJ HTTP Client file. Run this service first (mvn spring-boot:run),
### then execute requests below with the green arrow next to each one.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Generate a checklist - tropical trip with beach and hiking
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climate": "tropical",
  "tripLengthDays": 7,
  "adults": 2,
  "children": 1,
  "toddlers": 0,
  "activities": ["beach", "hiking"]
}

### Generate a checklist - cold trip with winter sports, toddler included
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climate": "cold",
  "tripLengthDays": 5,
  "adults": 2,
  "toddlers": 1,
  "activities": ["winter_sports"]
}

### Generate a checklist - business trip, minimal fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climate": "mild",
  "tripLengthDays": 3,
  "adults": 1,
  "activities": ["business", "formal_event"]
}

### Unknown climate is rejected with 400 and an explanatory message
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climate": "arctic",
  "tripLengthDays": 3
}

### Unknown activity is rejected with 400 and an explanatory message
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climate": "warm",
  "tripLengthDays": 3,
  "activities": ["skydiving"]
}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
